  <?php $holidayDates=$pdo->query('SELECT holiday_date FROM public_holidays')->fetchAll(PDO::FETCH_COLUMN);$defaultPeriod=date('Y-m');$defaultPayDate=payroll_default_pay_date($pdo,$defaultPeriod);?><div class="payroll-rule-note"><b>Payroll timing</b><span>Salary for each month is paid on the 7th of the following month. The joining month is prorated by scheduled workdays, excluding Sundays and configured public holidays.</span><b>Automatic deductions</b><span>Employee PF: selected 10% or 12% of eligible PF wages (wage definition and ₹25,000 cap applied). Employer PF is displayed separately and is not taken from net pay.</span><span>Gujarat professional tax: ₹0 up to ₹12,000 monthly wages; ₹200 above ₹12,000, unless marked exempt.</span></div><div class="payroll-preview" data-joining-date="<?=e($person['joining_date'])?>" data-holidays="<?=e(json_encode($holidayDates))?>"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Live monthly estimate</h3><p>Updates as you edit the salary structure and monthly adjustments.</p></div></div><div class="payroll-preview-grid"><div><small>Gross earnings</small><b data-payroll-gross>₹0.00</b></div><div><small>Payable workdays</small><b data-payroll-days>—</b></div><div><small>Eligible PF wages</small><b data-payroll-wage>₹0.00</b></div><div><small>Employee PF</small><b data-payroll-pf>₹0.00</b></div><div><small>Gujarat professional tax</small><b data-payroll-pt>₹0.00</b></div><div><small>Other deductions</small><b data-payroll-other-deduction>₹0.00</b></div><div class="preview-net"><small>Estimated net pay</small><b data-payroll-net>₹0.00</b></div></div></div><?php endif;?><?php endif;?></section>
